msgid "First is the `multi_vehicle.sh script <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Airsim/multi_vehicle.sh>`__ which launches multiple ArduCopter binaries with different SYSIDs and ports for each vehicle. Usage is similar to the above script -"
